  "summary": "The product is an MCP server exposing 18 tools over JSON-RPC via a Streamable HTTP /mcp endpoint, with Bearer-token API-key auth, plus a REST API and dashboard. The system comprises three services: corn-mcp on :8317, a Hono REST API (corn-api) on :4000 with SQLite, and a Next.js dashboard (corn-web) on :3000.",
